		{
			dependencies: ["4B96C1D7001D2F8E"]
			description: [
				"&aSAG 磨坊&f（sag_mill）把原矿磨成 2 倍矿粉，并可磨石头、石英等。"
				""
				"它吃&a研磨球&f（grinding ball）提升副产物倍率，各合金都有球：conductive_alloy_grinding_ball、copper_alloy_grinding_ball、dark_steel_grinding_ball、end_steel_grinding_ball、soularium_grinding_ball、vibrant_alloy_grinding_ball。"
				""
				"研磨球会逐渐损耗，记得自动补充。"
